1:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied with direct pre- and post-restart observations. The provider-wide restart protocol is complete for node1: a healthy pre-restart state and boot ID were captured, restart scheduling was acknowledged, the post-restart boot ID changed, and the recovered system retained the account and effective limits with no failed units. Fixed lifecycle boot identities independently corroborate the restart.","limitations":[]}
